{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["Edgar Cayce, who was believed to be psychic, suggested that the Bermuda Triangle was the location of which of the following?","Atlantis"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
