{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["The disappearance of Theodosia Burr Alston, daughter of former US Vice President Aaron Burr, has been cited in relation to the Bermuda Triangle. She was a passenger aboard what ship when she disappeared?","The Patriot"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
